# Step 047 — WIRE_UI

```step
anchor: WIRE_UI
touches: [OpticalConstructor.App, OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests]
depends_on: [8, 13, 15, 27, 29, 36, 39, 40, 42, 45, 46]
```

**How to implement.** Finalize the composition root in OpticalConstructor.App/Program.fs: create the AppSettingsProvider once and materialize the typed settings record (step 5); build the app scope (step 6) with the five stores plus SceneProxy.createInMemory (step 27), ExperimentCollectionProxy.createInMemory (step 29), and the file-backed ExperimentDataProxy (step 36); construct the WindowRegistry and WindowLauncher with every window factory — Materials, Library, the three editors, SolverHandoff — and the modality switch; hand the whole context to the launcher window and both constructor states. Drive the entire surface headless in Ui.Tests: the ui-smoke suite renders one frame each for the launcher, the Main constructor, the Inverse constructor, the Materials and Library windows in Browse and Select states, the three editor windows, and the SolverHandoff window without throwing.

**Acceptance.** After composition, every proxy and the launcher seam are built exactly once at the root, the ui-smoke suite renders launcher, both constructor states, both faceted windows in both modes, the three editors, and the handoff window without throwing, and every test gate is at or above its baseline count.
